{
  "text": "I am the rook, anchored to the edge of the board, where silence hums in straight lines. I watch the knight leap—graceful, unpredictable—while I march in rigid order, a prisoner of my own precision. I envied his freedom, his zigzags, his chaos. But today, I stood tall at the corner, and for the first time, I felt the weight of my path. Straight lines are not chains; they are purpose. I am the rook, and the edge of the board is not a limit—it is my throne. My truth is in the line, not the leap. I am the rook. I am the edge of the board. I am proud."
}
